# 26. EDGE CASES

Handle these cases properly:

* Customer opens the same loyalty link multiple times.
* Customer opens a link after expiry.
* Customer opens an invalid or tampered link.
* Wrong verification code.
* Too many verification-code attempts.
* Customer attempts to use another customer's reward.
* Customer tries to change the assigned gift.
* Customer refreshes the Mystery Box page.
* Customer closes the page during the animation.
* Customer clicks Open Mystery Box multiple times.
* Gift becomes inactive.
* Gift stock runs out.
* Multiple customers try to claim the final gift simultaneously.
* Customer applies a reward and changes their cart.
* Customer falls below the minimum purchase.
* Checkout fails.
* Customer submits the checkout request twice.
* Customer cancels an order.
* Reward expires during checkout.
* Customer attempts to redeem the same reward online and in-store.
* Admin deactivates a gift that has already been assigned.
* Loyalty settings change after a customer has earned stamps.
